   147	
   148	### Finite contract and exhaustive reduction
   149	
   150	The full target is `((11,5,4))_2`, which would beat the dimension-four lower bound in [P3, Table 1]. We restricted the **construction frame**, not the classical word set, to the 32 simple undirected circulant graphs
